                        "review": "I hate these limitations from research, when you research one thing, then you cannot research something else.\r\nCannot exterminate aliens because of humans being democratic.\r\nCannot copy ship design if you want to make another ship design. This is so stupid, i must now remember everyhing to make a new design. I just want to copy and make some changes...NOPE, devs of game said you must SUFFER.\r\nGraphics not good, outdated.\r\nZoom take like forever with mouse scroll. You scroll and scroll and scroll and you only zoomed a small bit.\r\nYou seem to fight with the UI/UX the whole time.\r\nNo QOL features, everything so difficult and basic to control.\r\nBuild que button to move something up so small, if you miss click, you remove your item that you wanted to build, so if you have built a bit already, its all lost.\r\nMuch better space games out there.",
                        "timestamp_created": 1792246851,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1792246851,
                        "voted_up": false,
                        "votes_up": 1,
                        "votes_funny": 0,
                        "weighted_vote_score": 0.523809552192688,
