                        "steam_purchase": true,
                        "received_for_free": false,
                        "written_during_early_access": false,
                        "developer_response": "Hi Wollie, an advanced game option will be added this month for regular species to be able to research prior techs.\n\nCustom species allow you to change government types, Democratic species gain a number of powerful bonuses but genocide is not part of their wheelhouse. You can make a custom human species if you want evil humans :-)\n\nSorry to hear about your UI frustrations but try the following:\n\nYou can copy past designs using the pulldown on the right of the ship designer to grab other designs. You can also use the \"edit\" button of an existing design to copy them :-)\n\nMouse sensitivity can be adjusted for scrolling, panning, and zoom in settings, and shift+movement also speeds up panning.",
